# Faerie Dreamthief: "{2}{B}, Exile this card from your graveyard: You draw a card and you lose 1 life." Faithless
# Looting puts it into the graveyard (discarding it with an Island). Black Lotus's {R}{R}{R} pays Looting's {R}; the
# remaining {R}{R} cannot pay {2}{B} (no black source yet), so the ability is refused; once Mox Jet is cast and adds {B} it is offered, exiles
# the card as a cost, and Bot1 draws the top card (a Mountain) and loses exactly 1 life (20 -> 19).

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Faithless Looting
Faerie Dreamthief
Mox Jet
Island x2
Plains x3
Mountain x9

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Red)
Bot1.Hand.Faithless Looting.Cast
Bot1.Choose(Faerie Dreamthief; Island)
? Bot1.Graveyard = Faithless Looting; Island; Faerie Dreamthief; Black Lotus
? Bot1.Mana = {R}{R}
! Bot1.Graveyard.Faerie Dreamthief.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Graveyard.Faerie Dreamthief.Activate

[Expect]
Exile = Faerie Dreamthief
Bot1.Life = 19
Bot1.Graveyard = Faithless Looting; Island; Black Lotus
Bot1.Hand = Island; Plains; Plains; Plains; Mountain
Bot1.Library.Count = 8
